00:20:35,728 --> 00:20:37,828
ありがとうございます！本当に！
Thank you so much, really!

166
00:20:37,828 --> 00:20:42,228
いやー、めちゃくちゃかっこいい曲を歌わせていただきましたが、皆さんいかがでしたかー？
We got to perform such an awesome song together! How did everyone like it?

167
00:20:43,728 --> 00:20:45,428
「ニコたん良かったね」って！
"Niko-tan was great," they say!

168
00:20:45,428 --> 00:20:47,228
いやもう、ニコたんのことはいいんですって！
No, enough about Niko-tan already!

169
00:20:47,228 --> 00:20:48,728
「ニコたん良かったね」って。
"Niko-tan was great!"

170
00:20:48,728 --> 00:20:53,028
そんなことよりですよ、ルイ先輩！ニコたんなんかより、今日重大告知もあるし…
More importantly, Lui-senpai! Forget about me, today you have a major announcement and...

171
00:20:53,028 --> 00:20:54,028
そうなんです。
That's right.

172
00:20:54,028 --> 00:20:55,428
し、新衣装も…
N-New outfit too...

173
00:20:55,428 --> 00:20:56,728
新衣装もあるんです！
There's a new outfit too!

174
00:20:56,728 --> 00:20:57,828
出るんでしたっけ？
You're revealing it, right?

175
00:20:57,828 --> 00:21:03,228
これね、たくさんね、ここのハッシュタグ「鷹嶺ルイ超重大生誕LIVE」ってありますんで、
Yes! We have this hashtag on screen, "#TakaneLuiSuperMajorBirthdayLIVE,"

176
00:21:03,228 --> 00:21:07,728
それでたくさんたくさん、もうポストしてくれたら嬉しいなと思うんですけど、
so I'd be so happy if you could post a lot using it.

177
00:21:07,728 --> 00:21:10,228
今日はたくさん告知もありますし、
We have plenty of announcements today,

178
00:21:10,228 --> 00:21:11,628
そうですよねー！
That's true!

179
00:21:11,628 --> 00:21:15,628
いや、重大告知のもうデッカさも気になるんですけど、
I'm curious about the massive announcements of course,

180
00:21:15,628 --> 00:21:18,428
新衣装がやっぱね、気になる！
but I'm really curious about the new outfit!

181
00:21:18,428 --> 00:21:22,428
やっぱルイ先輩といえば、ちょっとダークネスな感じなのかなーとか思ったり。
When I think of Lui-senpai, I wonder if it's going to be a bit dark...

182
00:21:22,428 --> 00:21:25,228
黒系なのかなーみたいな。
like black-themed or something.

183
00:21:25,228 --> 00:21:27,228
あー、なるほどなるほどなるほど。そう思いますよね。
Ah, I see, I see, I see. You'd think so, right?

184
00:21:27,228 --> 00:21:28,028
はい。
Yes.

185
00:21:28,028 --> 00:21:29,228
ま、それもあります！
Well, there's that too!

186
00:21:29,228 --> 00:21:30,528
えぇっ！？ それも？
Eh?! That too?

187
00:21:30,528 --> 00:21:31,428
はい。
Yes.

188
00:21:31,428 --> 00:21:32,228
ということは？
Which means...?

189
00:21:32,228 --> 00:21:35,228
最初ね、あの固定でも書かせていただいたんですけど、
As I wrote in the pinned comment earlier,

190
00:21:35,228 --> 00:21:38,728
新衣装は最初サブカラーで、
the new outfit starts with a sub-color,

191
00:21:38,728 --> 00:21:43,228
ちょっと清楚な感じの衣装になっております。
and it's a bit of a pure, elegant-styled outfit.

192
00:21:43,228 --> 00:21:46,228
え！？ それもある…？ ここ、ここにもあるって…
What?! There's that too...? You mean here too...?

193
00:21:46,228 --> 00:21:49,728
はい、めちゃくちゃ大量に差分を用意しておりますので、
Yes, we've prepared a massive amount of variations,

194
00:21:49,728 --> 00:21:51,228
最後までね、楽し…
so until the very end, pleas--

195
00:21:51,228 --> 00:21:52,728
なんかすごい騒いでる。
She's getting super hyper.

196
00:21:52,728 --> 00:21:54,228
おかしいよ！差分が！
That's crazy! All those variations!

197
00:21:54,228 --> 00:21:56,728
もういいや。今日は来てくれてありがとう！
Whatever! Thanks for coming today!

198
00:21:56,728 --> 00:21:59,728
あ、わかりました！私、楽屋で応援してます！それでは…
Ah, got it! I'll be cheering you on from the dressing room! Well then...

199
00:21:59,728 --> 00:22:03,228
あ、違います違います！そちらあの、舞踏会会場なんで。
Ah, no no no! Over there is the ballroom venue.

200
00:22:03,228 --> 00:22:04,828
だ、ダメなんですか、ニコたんは？
I-Is Niko-tan not allowed?

201
00:22:04,828 --> 00:22:08,228
はい、ニコたんは呼んでない。招待状もらってないでしょ？
Right, Niko-tan isn't invited. You didn't get an invitation, did you?

202
00:22:08,228 --> 00:22:09,228
もらってないけど！
I didn't, but...!

203
00:22:09,228 --> 00:22:12,028
うん。じゃあ、あのすいませんが楽屋の方にあちらから…
Yeah. So sorry, but the dressing room is that way...

204
00:22:12,028 --> 00:22:13,028
なんでだよー！
Whyyy?!

205
00:22:13,028 --> 00:22:14,728
はい、スタッフさんお願いします。
Staff, please take care of her.

206
00:22:14,728 --> 00:22:16,828
ルイ先輩、お立ち止まりいただきありがとうございます。
Lui-senpai, thank you for stopping by!

207
00:22:16,828 --> 00:22:19,728
ありがと、ありがと。ありがと… 悪質やな。
Thanks, thanks, thanks... You're relentless.

208
00:22:19,728 --> 00:22:20,728
頑張ってください！
Do your best!

209
00:22:20,728 --> 00:22:22,728
ありがと、ありがとね！ありがとねー！
Thank you, thank you! Thanks!

210
00:22:23,228 --> 00:22:25,728
ということでニコたんに来ていただきました。
And that was Niko-tan joining us!

211
00:22:25,728 --> 00:22:30,728
はい、新衣装もね、たくさん見せていきますので、最後まで楽しんでいただけたらなと思います。
Yes, I'll be showing lots of the new outfit, so I hope you enjoy until the very end!

212
00:22:30,728 --> 00:22:34,228
楽屋のニコたんも楽しんでくださいねー！
Niko-tan in the dressing room, have fun too!

213
00:22:34,228 --> 00:22:38,228
それでは聞いてください。『ZIG-ZAG』。
Now then, please listen to: "ZIG-ZAG."

214
00:22:52,228 --> 00:22:54,228
One, two, three, four

215
00:22:54,228 --> 00:22:59,228
ZIG-ZAG
作詞・作曲・編曲：中村歩 / 吉村隆行
[Song: ZIG-ZAG / Lyrics, Music, Arrangement: Ayumu Nakamura / Takayuki Yoshimura]

216
00:23:02,228 --> 00:23:06,228
幸せって囁いたあとで　ラッタッタラッタ
After whispering about happiness, rat-tat-ta-rat-ta

217
00:23:06,228 --> 00:23:10,228
こびりついて離れわ駄目だ　ラッタッタラッタ
Clinging on and refusing to let go, no good, rat-tat-ta-rat-ta

218
00:23:10,228 --> 00:23:14,728
無味無臭の喪失感が　思い出せないや
A tasteless, odorless sense of loss, I can't even remember

219
00:23:14,728 --> 00:23:19,028
忘れたいから歌った　馬鹿だ　ラッタッタラッタ
I sang because I wanted to forget, what an idiot, rat-tat-ta-rat-ta

220
00:23:19,028 --> 00:23:22,728
怨むことも　憎むことも
Neither resenting nor hating,

221
00:23:22,728 --> 00:23:27,228
賢くない故　出来なかった
I wasn't smart enough to do either.

222
00:23:27,228 --> 00:23:31,028
これが君の結末ならば
If this is your conclusion,

223
00:23:31,028 --> 00:23:34,728
笑ってしまいたい
I just want to laugh it off.

224
00:23:34,728 --> 00:23:36,228
本当？
Really?

225
00:23:36,228 --> 00:23:38,228
嘘、嘘、嘘
Lie, lie, lie...

226
00:23:38,228 --> 00:23:39,628
嘘つき
Liar.

227
00:23:39,628 --> 00:23:41,628
大体 大体 大体な
Mostly, mostly, mostly,

228
00:23:41,628 --> 00:23:43,628
奇跡とかちょっと望んじゃって
I found myself wishing a little for miracles,

229
00:23:43,628 --> 00:23:45,428
もう嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌
and I hate it, hate it, hate it, hate it, hate it!

230
00:23:45,428 --> 00:23:48,228
タッチだ ワン・ツー・イン・ワン・レッツ
Touch, one-two-in-one-lets!

231
00:23:48,228 --> 00:23:50,228
痛い痛い痛いな
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts,

232
00:23:50,228 --> 00:23:52,228
おかしいとこ全部抉り取って
Gouging out all the broken parts,

233
00:23:52,228 --> 00:23:54,228
悪評で結構
Bad reputation is totally fine,

234
00:23:54,228 --> 00:23:56,228
好きに呼んでいいよ
feel free to call me whatever you want.

235
00:23:56,228 --> 00:23:58,828
トラウマにバイバイしたいのです
I just want to say bye-bye to trauma,

236
00:23:58,828 --> 00:24:01,228
です　で、で、で、です
I do, I, I, I, I do!

237
00:24:08,728 --> 00:24:11,228
私、甘え上手になれなかった
I couldn't be good at acting spoiled,

238
00:24:11,228 --> 00:24:13,728
可愛げとかが足りなかった
lacking in charm and cuteness.

239
00:24:13,728 --> 00:24:15,428
幸福かい？
Are you happy?

240
00:24:15,428 --> 00:24:18,028
うるさい、愚弄った？
Shut up, are you mocking me?

241
00:24:18,028 --> 00:24:20,228
過去は過去だと割り切っちゃえば
If I just brush it off as "the past is the past,"

242
00:24:20,228 --> 00:24:23,428
「きっといいことあるさ」とかそれくらい
"I'm sure good things will happen" and all that,

243
00:24:23,428 --> 00:24:26,228
百も承知だ　ラッタッタ
I already know full well, rat-tat-ta!

244
00:24:26,228 --> 00:24:29,728
願うことも　祈ることも
Neither wishing nor praying

245
00:24:29,728 --> 00:24:34,228
許されないから黒く染めた
is permitted, so I dyed it black.

246
00:24:34,228 --> 00:24:38,228
元の色も思い出せない
I can't even remember the original color anymore,

247
00:24:38,228 --> 00:24:41,428
絡んだ運命の
the entangled threads

248
00:24:41,428 --> 00:24:45,728
糸　糸　糸　糸
of fate, thread, thread, thread...

249
00:24:45,728 --> 00:24:48,028
大体 大体 大体な
Mostly, mostly, mostly,

250
00:24:48,028 --> 00:24:50,228
悲劇のヒロイン気取っちゃって
putting on the act of a tragic heroine,

251
00:24:50,228 --> 00:24:52,228
もう嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌
and I hate it, hate it, hate it, hate it, hate it!

252
00:24:52,228 --> 00:24:55,028
諦めちゃえば？
Why not just give up?

253
00:24:55,028 --> 00:24:57,228
でも会いたい 会いたい 会いたいな
But I want to see you, want to see you, want to see you,

254
00:24:57,228 --> 00:24:59,428
思考回路が混んがらがっちゃって
My train of thought gets all tangled up,

255
00:24:59,428 --> 00:25:01,228
明日またきっと
Tomorrow, surely once again...

256
00:25:01,045 --> 00:25:03,045
壊すけどいいの
Is it okay if I break it?

257
00:25:03,045 --> 00:25:07,845
トラウマにバイバイしたいのです です で・で・で・です
I want to say bye-bye to my trauma, yes, yes, y-y-y-yes!

258
00:25:33,445 --> 00:25:36,745
夢の中で君と
In my dreams, with you,

259
00:25:36,745 --> 00:25:39,845
手を繋いでいるの
I'm holding hands,

260
00:25:39,845 --> 00:25:46,045
何も知らないあの頃の 二人のままで
just like the two of us back then who knew nothing.

261
00:25:46,045 --> 00:25:52,345
でも解っているよ すぐに覚めてしまうと
But I know that I'll wake up soon,

262
00:25:52,345 --> 00:25:55,645
それならばいっそ 君の手でそっと
so if that's the case, gently with your own hands,

263
00:25:55,645 --> 00:25:58,645
止め刺して
deliver the finishing blow.

264
00:25:58,645 --> 00:26:03,145
ほら 今 今 今！
Come on, now, now, now!

265
00:26:03,145 --> 00:26:07,645
やだ 痛い痛い痛い痛いな 奇跡とかちょっと望んじゃって
No, it hurts, hurts, hurts, hurts, hoping just a bit for a miracle.

266
00:26:07,645 --> 00:26:11,645
もう嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌！ タチが悪いわ
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way! My attitude is terrible.

267
00:26:11,645 --> 00:26:16,345
ねえ 辛い lie lie lie 否？ おかしいとこ全部抉り取って
Hey, painful lie, lie, lie, isn't it? Gouge out all the messed up parts.

268
00:26:16,345 --> 00:26:20,145
薄情で結構 好きに呼んでいいよ
Cold-hearted is fine, call me whatever you want.

269
00:26:20,145 --> 00:26:24,545
トラウマにバイバイしたいのです です で・で・で・です
I want to say bye-bye to my trauma, yes, yes, y-y-y-yes!

270
00:26:24,545 --> 00:26:27,545
です です で・で・で・です
Yes, yes, y-y-y-yes!

271
00:26:53,445 --> 00:26:58,745
世界欺く揺るぎない正義
An unwavering justice that deceives the world,

272
00:26:58,745 --> 00:27:05,245
ほどいて真実 この手の中
untangling it, the truth is within my grasp.

273
00:27:10,045 --> 00:27:15,045
アイのシナリオ
[Ai no Scenario]

274
00:27:20,145 --> 00:27:25,445
大胆不敵な影が華麗に踊る
A bold and fearless shadow dances magnificently,

275
00:27:25,445 --> 00:27:30,745
君が隠してる秘密 いつか聞かせてよ
the secret you're hiding, tell me about it someday.

276
00:27:30,745 --> 00:27:36,345
伸ばした手で触れる事は誰もできない
Nobody can reach out and touch it,

277
00:27:36,345 --> 00:27:41,545
君が隠してる世界 僕に見させてよ
the world you're hiding, let me see it.

278
00:27:41,545 --> 00:27:45,845
揺れる難解な心
An intricate, wavering heart,

279
00:27:45,845 --> 00:27:51,745
解き明かして奪うその瞳
unraveling it to captivate those eyes.

280
00:27:51,745 --> 00:27:57,145
不安がって泣いてたって見つけらんないよ
Being anxious and crying won't help you find it.

281
00:27:57,145 --> 00:28:02,645
狙う真実はどこへ消えた
Where did the truth you seek vanish to?

282
00:28:02,645 --> 00:28:08,245
たとえ世界欺く解答だとしても
Even if it's an answer that deceives the world,

283
00:28:08,245 --> 00:28:13,645
「信じて」差し出す掌
"Trust me," I hold out my hand.

284
00:28:13,645 --> 00:28:18,545
決して逃げない 怖くはないから
I'll never run away, because I'm not afraid.

285
00:28:18,545 --> 00:28:25,445
目を開け弱さをかき消すんだ
Open your eyes and banish all weakness!

286
00:28:37,545 --> 00:28:42,745
繰り返される運命に君は気づいてる？
Are you aware of this repeating destiny?

287
00:28:42,745 --> 00:28:48,145
僕が隠してる秘密 いつか聞かせるよ
The secret I'm hiding, I'll tell you someday.

288
00:28:48,145 --> 00:28:53,345
歩み寄る偽りの影 君は知らない
An approaching shadow of deceit, you do not know.

289
00:28:53,345 --> 00:28:58,545
芽生えた記憶は絡む 必然の棘で
Sprouting memories are entwined with inevitable thorns.

290
00:28:58,545 --> 00:29:03,745
守りたい想いで ただ立ち向かって
Driven by the desire to protect, I simply stand up

291
00:29:03,745 --> 00:29:09,345
ほどくその絆
and untangle those bonds.

292
00:29:09,345 --> 00:29:14,745
何度だって助けるって揺るぎはしないよ
I will save you again and again, I will never waver.

293
00:29:14,745 --> 00:29:20,345
隠す真実はどこへ消えた
Where did the hidden truth vanish to?

294
00:29:20,345 --> 00:29:25,945
たとえ世界を敵に回したとしても
Even if we turn the whole world against us,

295
00:29:25,945 --> 00:29:31,245
信じて僕だけ 未来も
believe only in me, and our future too.

296
00:29:31,245 --> 00:29:36,245
決して逃げない 迷いはないから
I'll never run away, because there is no doubt in my mind.

297
00:29:36,245 --> 00:29:42,545
シナリオ壊して抗うんだ
Break the scenario and fight back!

298
00:30:13,665 --> 00:30:18,965
世界を敵に回したとしても
Even if the whole world turns into my enemy,

299
00:30:18,965 --> 00:30:23,965
「信じて」差し出す掌
I'll say \"trust me\" and hold out my hand.

300
00:30:24,165 --> 00:30:27,165
決して離さない
I will never let go,

301
00:30:27,165 --> 00:30:30,165
答えは届いた
the answer has reached me.

302
00:30:30,165 --> 00:30:33,165
結んだ運命
This tied-together fate...

303
00:30:33,165 --> 00:30:36,365
この手の中
is right here in my hands.

304
00:30:36,465 --> 00:30:41,165
繰り返された 答えだとしても
Even if it's an answer that repeats itself...

305
00:30:45,665 --> 00:30:49,165
決して逃げない
I will never run away,

306
00:30:49,165 --> 00:30:53,165
怖くはないから
because there's nothing to be afraid of.

307
00:30:54,665 --> 00:30:57,665
抗うんだ
I'm going to fight back!

308
00:31:21,165 --> 00:31:24,665
何度も 何度も
Again and again, again and again,

309
00:31:24,665 --> 00:31:27,665
走り続けるよ
I'll keep on running!

310
00:31:28,165 --> 00:31:29,665
Wake up! 同心円
Wake up! Concentric circles,

311
00:31:29,665 --> 00:31:31,165
Shift up! 見回して
Shift up! Look around!

312
00:31:31,165 --> 00:31:34,165
Speed up! ハートバイティング U.M.A. NEW WORLD!
Speed up! Heart-biting, U.M.A. NEW WORLD!

313
00:31:34,165 --> 00:31:36,165
Jump up! 頂点へ
Jump up! To the top!

314
00:31:36,165 --> 00:31:37,665
Turn up! 声合わせて
Turn up! Unite our voices!

315
00:31:37,665 --> 00:31:41,165
Dream on! 未来繋いで U.M.A. NEW WORLD!
Dream on! Connecting the future, U.M.A. NEW WORLD!

316
00:31:41,165 --> 00:31:44,165
最高潮コンディション 調子ガンガン研ぎ澄ましてこう
Peak condition, let's sharpen our rhythm!

317
00:31:44,165 --> 00:31:46,665
栄光のチャンピオンコース 虎視眈々と狙ってこう
Let's steadily aim for the glorious champion course!

318
00:31:46,665 --> 00:31:49,165
マイペースに（マイペース！）気合レースに超集中
At my own pace (my pace!), super focused on the spirited race!

319
00:31:49,165 --> 00:31:53,165
駆けるセーブは限界 ハートに引火！ U.M.A. Let's go!
Running without holding back, igniting our hearts! U.M.A. Let's go!

320
00:31:53,165 --> 00:31:56,165
最高潮アンビション 一騎打ちの大勝負
Peak ambition, a head-to-head showdown!

321
00:31:56,165 --> 00:31:59,665
成功のチャンスを 全力出して掴んでこう
Let's give it our all and seize the chance of success!

322
00:31:59,665 --> 00:32:01,665
ハイペースより（ハイペース！）気合レースに猛進中
Faster than high-paced (high pace!), charging straight into the spirited race!

323
00:32:01,665 --> 00:32:06,165
覚悟思いをセット 突っ走ってこう
Setting our determination and feelings, let's sprint forward!

324
00:32:07,165 --> 00:32:10,165
友と二人 競い合った 風の中でも
Even in the wind where I competed alongside my friend,

325
00:32:10,165 --> 00:32:13,165
大きな背中 追いかけてた 雨の中でも
even in the rain where I chased after that great back,

326
00:32:13,165 --> 00:32:16,665
何百何千回と 組み交わされてきた
hundreds and thousands of times we crossed paths.

327
00:32:16,665 --> 00:32:20,165
